<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-AUXERRE 0 BORUSSIA DORTMUND 1 - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AUXERRE 0 BORUSSIA DORTMUND 1 - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>AUXERRE, France 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Borussia Dortmund of Germany beat Auxerre of France 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in their European Cup quarter-final second leg match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Lars Ricken 59</p>
<p>Attendance: 21,000</p>
<p>Borussia win 4-1 on aggregate</p>
